    {
      "stepId": "submission-confirmation",
      "title": "Application submitted",
      "behaviours": [],
      "markdownContent": "A copy of your request has been sent to the email address you gave and to the Environmental Health Department at **{polyclinic}**.\n\n## What happens next\n\n* The Environmental Health Department at **{polyclinic}** will review your request.  \n* They will review it and may contact you if they need more information.   \n* The property will be inspected before it is registered.  \n* If your application is approved, you will receive a confirmation email and the Environment Health Office will mail your registration. In addition, you can also request to collect it from your assigned polyclinic.\n\nSubmitting an application does not mean that the lodging house or barracks has been registered.\n\n## Contact\n\nIf you need help, contact your Environmental Health Service office.\n\n{polyclinicContact}",
      "elements": []
    }
